{"nodes": [{"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/UN-005", "kind": "need", "label": "UN-005", "text": "The current approved specification set (device master record) and the record of each release (device history record) are identifiable and retrievable from the system."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/UN-004", "kind": "need", "label": "UN-004", "text": "The document control system satisfies the applicable 21 CFR Part 11 controls for electronic records and electronic signatures."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/UN-003", "kind": "need", "label": "UN-003", "text": "A released document set is retrievable, complete, and human-readable throughout the retention period."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/UN-002", "kind": "need", "label": "UN-002", "text": "No change reaches the controlled document set without review and approval by an independent, authorized signer."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/UN-001", "kind": "need", "label": "UN-001", "text": "An auditor can identify the current approved revision of any controlled document, who approved it, and its complete change history."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-9", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-9", "text": "Every pull request to the default branch shall run the design controls (the design gate, the acceptance tests, verification, the release gate and graph validation) through RDM's reusable gates pinned to a released revision, and the Part 11 gap analysis, and the ruleset shall require exactly the checks that workflow reports.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-8", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-8", "text": "Each document release shall produce a device history record: a manifest recording the tag, commit SHA, releasing actor, timestamp, and artifact list, attached to the release alongside the copies.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-7", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-7", "text": "The device master record shall be a controlled index document enumerating the specification set, rendered from index data that is generated from the controlled documents' own frontmatter, so it lists each controlled document with its identity and revision.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-6", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-6", "text": "Repository merge behavior shall be declared as configuration code: pull requests merge only by merge commit so the reviewed SHA is preserved in history, squash and rebase merges are disabled, head branches are deleted on merge, and the setup script shall apply and drift-check these settings against the live repository.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-5", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-5", "text": "The document control procedure shall address every item of the Part 11 document-control checklist, with the gap analysis reporting full coverage.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-4", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-4", "text": "Each rendered controlled document shall embed its revision history from repository data, not a hand-maintained table.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-3", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-3", "text": "A document release shall be triggered by pushing a release tag and shall attach both human-readable rendered copies and a complete electronic archive of the document set to the release.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-2", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-2", "text": "Every controlled document shall declare its identity and revision in frontmatter.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-1", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-1", "text": "Changes to the default branch shall require a pull request with at least one code-owner approval, verified commit signatures, passing status checks, and protection against history rewriting and branch deletion, enforced by a repository ruleset kept as configuration code.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-11", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-11", "text": "A scheduled audit shall compare the live ruleset and repository settings with the checked-in configuration at least daily, and shall fail on any difference.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:input/DI-10", "kind": "input", "label": "DI-10", "text": "A document release shall be published only if the release gate passes on the released commit, and shall attach that commit's verification evidence (the evidence bundle and its verification report) with the copies.", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release", "kind": "context", "label": "release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records", "kind": "context", "label": "records"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval", "kind": "context", "label": "approval"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-DC-006", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-DC-006", "text": "A change is approved under another person's account.", "level": "High", "decision": "accepted", "category": "security"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-DC-005", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-DC-005", "text": "A released copy differs from the approved content.", "level": "Medium", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-DC-004", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-DC-004", "text": "A release is published from a commit whose verification failed.", "level": "High", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-DC-003", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-DC-003", "text": "An approval cannot be tied to the revision it approved.", "level": "High", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "security"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-DC-002", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-DC-002", "text": "The approval path is weakened on the service provider, outside the reviewed configuration.", "level": "Medium", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "security"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-DC-001", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-DC-001", "text": "An unapproved change reaches the controlled document set.", "level": "High", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/sop", "kind": "component", "label": "Document control procedure", "text": "SOP-DC-001: identity, revision history, the Part 11 controls it cites", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records", "container": "Controlled record", "code": "dhf/documents/procedures/document_control_procedure.md"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/settings_applier", "kind": "component", "label": "Settings applier", "text": "Applies the ruleset and merge settings, and checks them for drift", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval", "container": "Controlled record", "code": "setup.sh"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/ruleset", "kind": "component", "label": "Branch ruleset", "text": "What a change must pass to reach the default branch: reviews, signed commits, required checks, linear history", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval", "container": "Controlled record", "code": ".github/rulesets/controlled-documents.json"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/rendering", "kind": "component", "label": "Rendering", "text": "Renders the documents from their templates and data to PDF", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records", "container": "Controlled record", "code": "dhf/Makefile"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/release_workflow", "kind": "component", "label": "Release workflow", "text": "On a tag: verifies the release, renders the copies, writes the device history record, publishes the release", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release", "container": "Workflows", "code": ".github/workflows/release-documents.yml"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/record_data", "kind": "component", "label": "Record data", "text": "The revision history and the index data the documents embed", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records", "container": "Controlled record", "code": "dhf/data/"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/part11", "kind": "component", "label": "Part 11 checklist", "text": "The Part 11 controls a controlled document must reference", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records", "container": "Controlled record", "code": "checklists/part11_document_control.txt"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/merge_settings", "kind": "component", "label": "Merge settings", "text": "Only merge commits; branches deleted on merge", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval", "container": "Controlled record", "code": ".github/settings.json"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/drift_audit", "kind": "component", "label": "Drift audit", "text": "Checks the live repository settings against the declared ones, daily", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval", "container": "Workflows", "code": ".github/workflows/drift-audit.yml"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/dmr_index", "kind": "component", "label": "Device master record index", "text": "The current approved specification set, from generated index data", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/records", "container": "Controlled record", "code": "dhf/documents/procedures/device_master_record_index.md"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/design_controls", "kind": "component", "label": "Design-controls workflow", "text": "Runs RDM's gates and the record checks on every pull request: the required checks", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval", "container": "Workflows", "code": ".github/workflows/design-controls.yml"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:element/code_owners", "kind": "component", "label": "Code owners", "text": "Routes every controlled path to the quality team for review", "context": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/approval", "container": "Controlled record", "code": ".github/CODEOWNERS"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_release.py%3A%3Atest_a_release_is_published_only_when_verified_with_its_evidence", "kind": "test", "label": "examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_release.py::test_a_release_is_published_only_when_verified_with_its_evidence", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py%3A%3Atest_sop_addresses_every_part11_checklist_item", "kind": "test", "label": "examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py::test_sop_addresses_every_part11_checklist_item", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_release.py%3A%3Atest_release_writes_a_device_history_record", "kind": "test", "label": "examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_release.py::test_release_writes_a_device_history_record", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py%3A%3Atest_rendered_sop_embeds_generated_revision_history", "kind": "test", "label": "examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py::test_rendered_sop_embeds_generated_revision_history", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_approval.py%3A%3Atest_a_daily_audit_fails_on_any_drift", "kind": "test", "label": "examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_approval.py::test_a_daily_audit_fails_on_any_drift", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py%3A%3Atest_dmr_index_lists_the_specification_set_from_generated_data", "kind": "test", "label": "examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py::test_dmr_index_lists_the_specification_set_from_generated_data", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py%3A%3Atest_controlled_documents_declare_identity_and_revision", "kind": "test", "label": "examples/github-document-control/tests/acceptance/test_records.py::test_controlled_documents_declare_identity_and_revision", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:test/examples/github-document-control/tests/a